<h1>HR Analytics – Power BI</h1>

<h2>Business Problem</h2>
<p>
The organization lacked visibility into absenteeism and attrition drivers.
</p>

<h2>Data & Tools</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Power BI</li>
  <li>Excel</li>
</ul>

<h2>Approach</h2>
<p>
Data was cleaned, modeled, and visualized to highlight workforce trends.
</p>

<h2>Key Insights</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Overtime strongly influenced absenteeism</li>
  <li>Low job satisfaction increased attrition</li>
</ul>

<h2>Impact</h2>
<p>
Absenteeism reduced by 98% through data-driven interventions.
</p>
